Subject: [PATCH 258/307] !F (Terrain Integration) Suppress duplicate camera
 draws for integrated geometry.

Track whether every triangle of an object was accepted by the terrain sector.
At full integration level 2, suppress that object's camera draw only where the
terrain copy is complete, retaining fallback material for partial integration.
